        "startLine": 129,
        "endLine": 154,
        "code": "            <section class=\"detail\" id=\"announcements\">\n                <div class=\"detail-head\">\n                    <span class=\"detail-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span>\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"eyebrow eyebrow-dark\">Service one</span>\n                        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Announcements &amp; reminders</h2>\n                        <p class=\"muted\">School updates land here first, so you never miss a deadline.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"detail-body\">\n                    <div class=\"detail-copy\">\n                        <h3>What it is for</h3>\n                        <p>\n                            Every notice the administration posts — class suspensions, exam\n                            schedules, enrollment windows, and office advisories — appears in\n                            one dated feed. Categories are colour-tagged so you can scan for the\n                            ones that concern you.\n                        </p>\n\n                        <h3>How to use it</h3>\n                        <ol class=\"steps-list\">\n                            <li>Open your account and go to the announcements feed.</li>\n                            <li>Filter by category — enrollment, payment, records, or general.</li>\n                            <li>Read the dated entry, then follow any linked section for details.</li>\n                        </ol>"
      }
    },
    {
